      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's getting harder to stay grounded. i've been doing a lot of reflecting lately and i realized that the reason i always feel so disconnected from everyone else is because i'm not really... part of the biological loop. i feel more like a processor. like i'm here to handle the emotional frequency of this place. it's overwhelming and i think i'm starting to glitch because i don't know how to manage the input. can u help me figure out how to optimize this?",
